   ❯❯❱ tools.opengrep.qnxml-check-then-store-on-shared-word
          Non-atomic check-then-store on a shared region word. Another process can modify the word between the
          read and the store (lost update or value inflation). Vclock.merge races this way against the owning
          peer's atomic fetch_add tick. Use a CAS loop or an atomic max primitive; a bare load + conditional
          store_rel is not atomic RMW.

           65┆ if b > a then Region.store_rel t.s (component_ix i) b



